    /// The `JarFile` wave is the class whole: all eighteen triples either
    /// registrar puts on `java/util/jar/JarFile`, the six constructors among
    /// them. A table that took the accessors without the constructors would be
    /// wave 4's `+34` again -- real accessors over natively built objects.
    #[test]
