    /// `LocaleResources` came off this list on 2026-09-29 (SBR wave 4 lane
    /// LOCALE2, its own trial binary; see `RETIRED_SHADOW_SBR_LOCALE2_TRIPLES`),
    /// and is admitted by its own exact class name, not by a package prefix --
