    /// SBR round 2 wave 8 lane FFM: two layout factories and the seven
    /// `ScopedMemoryAccess` wrapper/twin pairs retire; the four rows tried and
    /// SBR round 2 wave 8 lane FFM: two layout factories and the seven public
    /// `ScopedMemoryAccess` wrappers retire; their reviewed Internal intrinsics
